    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto",
        "text": "Miss Ch'en, can I ask something?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "What?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto",
        "text": "You and Miss Lin are old friends, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "What makes you think so?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto",
        "text": "You certainly don't feel like enemies, there's not that much intensity. But suppose something went down between you two\u2014you still seem pretty well aware of each other."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "You could say that..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "We went to the same primary school, and we had a common acquaintance."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "So your guess is fairly close."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "But I won't be telling you why she and I don't get along."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#6",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto",
        "text": "That's alright. I can't imagine it's anything minor if it happened between people like you, and I don't plan on asking details. I was just throwing up a topic."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto",
        "text": "You know, though, it's like you never imagined she'd show up here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto",
        "text": "Slice it any way you want, it's like it was fated. Have you ever thought about making up with her before?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Do you care that much about this?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto",
        "text": "I don't really... or maybe I do. This city is all just money, money, money 'til the sun goes down. Things like friendship are a huge luxury."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "This isn't something we can just fix... even if either of us wanted to."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto",
        "text": "Wait a second. Miss Ch'en, look at that alley there."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$chasing_intro",
            "key": "$chasing_loop",
            "volume": 0.4
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_437_mizuki_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mizuki",
        "text": "Hm... this is kind of a bind."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_437_mizuki_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mizuki",
        "text": "With all these cameras, going too heavy-handed isn't gonna be a good look."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_205"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Irritated Contestant",
        "text": "Rgh, I don't know what it is, but I can't land a good hit on this runt. Something's not right!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_204"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Angered Contestant",
        "text": "He just thinks he can piss around with us. Let's take him together!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#7",
            "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto",
        "text": "Look at that. It's the solo contestant, stuck in an ambush."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto",
        "text": "What's your call, Miss Ch'en? Wait until they finish fighting?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#7",
            "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "...No."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#7",
            "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto",
        "text": "You're going to help him?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto",
        "text": "There's no real benefit to it. The championship isn't about helping your fellow contestants\u2014the disciplined approach doesn't fly here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I know. Just stay here and wait for me a moment."
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$rungeneral",
            "volume": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#7",
            "name2": "avg_486_espumo_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
