    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia",
        "text": "(I imagine, by 'actual job,' they mean more of these bombs, and it sounds as if there are several teams on it.)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia",
        "text": "(The officials might have prohibited comms equipment, but all signs indicate they have their own way of keeping in touch, under the radar.)"
